{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在在意的已经不只是把靠近说出来，而是这份靠近能不能继续占着两人之间的位置；因此当表达不再像前一段那样平稳延续时，他的注意并没有撤开，反而会围着“怎样还能停留在这里”反复打转。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H2已经建立：他在乎能在那个人身边多停留一会儿，即使表达放轻，靠近本身仍持续占据他的注意。\",\"bridge\":\"正因为“停留”本身成了他在乎的具体内容，表达方式一旦变得更不稳定、更频繁转换，他承受的就不只是情绪起伏，而是注意力始终不肯从这份靠近上移开；同一件事可以一面促使他反复靠回去，一面让他暂时抓住某个较持续的状态。\",\"current\":\"这一段快速往返、短促反复与较长持续之间的交替，可以理解为这种被“继续停留”占住的注意：他还没有得到什么新答案，也没有决定下一步，只是暂时无法把这份靠近当作已经表达完、可以放过去的事。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H2中“想在那个人身边多停留”的具体事实，这里的活跃和反复仍可被理解为一般的兴奋或波动，却没有足够理由特指为对‘靠近还能否继续占据当前位置’的牵挂。\"},\"used\":[\"H2\"],\"new_history\":[\"当他想在某个人身边继续停留时，如果靠近无法沿着同一种表达平稳延续，他的注意不会随表达变化而撤开，而会继续围着如何留在这份靠近里反复牵挂。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"解释依赖H2中已经建立的‘想多停留一会儿’，而不是仅把音乐变化改写成情绪强度；没有把间句、渐强或持续音当成对方回应、关系进展或新的外部事件。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "459e09f5-37d3-4b2e-be6a-283b454cc8a9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215118119386Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:51:57.062511+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0ed5c0020e041aefc582c6fb8b342dbcaeb80d3ac661113584a73890e717b3c3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215118119386Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f37c9a977216ae217c6f6f6281a62b453cc8a5409d9ecb3679497abf068c08be"}}}
